    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Frequently reminded about how she was rescued by faeries despite being a human, Lilika (renamable MC) has lived all her life repaying the faeries with her servitude \u2014 to cook, clean, and care for the heirs of an elite faerie family in the realm. When the family receives their annual invitation to an upcoming masquerade held by the High Court, Lilika is surprised to also receive an invitation letter, only to have her dreams crushed by the family\u2019s objections.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lilika refuses to let go of her dreams of romance and dancing amongst the sparkling high court faeries. Her wishes are soon heard by a mysterious flower spirit in the garden and the spirit helps Eve get to the ball.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Believing in the flower spirit, Lilika finds herself at the masquerade in a beautiful disguise and is able to put aside her human identity for a magical evening. But her night soon begins to unmask a stunning mystery - one that ties a clandestine prince, a grand magician, and a roguish knight to her destiny through passionate secrets and mysterious letters by moondusk.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3549690/extras/c013edf7dbbc8d2a8f92cbf39125bb3d.avif?t=1755565147\" data-has-big width=800 height=118 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are<strong> 3 romanceable love interests</strong>\u00a0in the main story of the game - Prince Kalon, Astromeria, and Llyr</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3549690/extras/561e6fff11c81f61c5253243345bd2d0.avif?t=1755565147\" data-has-big width=800 height=508 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3549690/extras/7fc2f5c6abab7ec5cee80edfd63adc35.avif?t=1755565147\" data-has-big width=800 height=508 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3549690/extras/48b9f4ad5a626872325eec835b0b1bdb.avif?t=1755565147\" width=1360 height=866 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3549690/extras/24352eb28c2f8250ce1b95b07e298b8c.avif?t=1755565147\" data-has-big width=800 height=118 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>Game Features</strong></u></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlockable CGs</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlockable Achievements</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple Endings</p></li></ul>",
